1
00:02:31,068 --> 00:02:40,568
All pirates searching for the treasure One Piece must brave the second half of the Grand Line.

2
00:02:41,068 --> 00:02:44,888
These wild and dangerous seas are known as the New World.

3
00:02:46,268 --> 00:02:51,508
Gold Roger and his crew were the only men to ever chart these waters and learn all the secrets they held.

4
00:02:52,008 --> 00:02:58,068
For the rest of the pirates of the world, this has proven to be the end of the road, a graveyard of dreams.

5
00:02:58,068 --> 00:03:08,428
Now, Monkey D. Luffy, a boy whose body became rubber after eating the gum gum fruit, set sail into the New World with his faithful crew.

6
00:03:09,008 --> 00:03:11,948
I will be the king of the pirates!

7
00:03:15,708 --> 00:03:23,808
During their journey to the New World, Luffy and his crew arrive on Fishman Island, which is located 10,000 meters below sea level.

8
00:03:23,808 --> 00:03:31,308
The Fishman Pirates, led by Horty Jones and assisted by Vander Deccan, plot to overthrow King Neptune.

9
00:03:32,948 --> 00:03:41,148
It's not long before the Straw Hats get pulled into the conflict, which results in Horty detaining Zorro, Usopp, and Brook.

10
00:03:42,648 --> 00:03:46,068
My soul, it's aching!

11
00:03:46,068 --> 00:03:48,168
Wait, that's it!

12
00:03:53,508 --> 00:03:54,568
What's so funny?

13
00:03:55,008 --> 00:03:55,768
My idea!

14
00:03:56,628 --> 00:04:01,488
If I can't end her existence, then I'll just have to end everyone else's!

15
00:04:02,548 --> 00:04:03,488
It's settled.

16
00:04:04,188 --> 00:04:06,568
That boy sure gave me a lot of trouble, though.

17
00:04:07,548 --> 00:04:09,828
We're leaving Hachi in your care, Kami!

18
00:04:10,328 --> 00:04:10,928
Right!

19
