160
00:09:10,108 --> 00:09:12,108
Did Jinbei rescue her only to get them both captured?

161
00:09:12,108 --> 00:09:14,108
I was ready for a fight,

162
00:09:14,108 --> 00:09:16,108
but I won't complain.

163
00:09:16,108 --> 00:09:18,108
Everyone I needed is neatly gathered here,

164
00:09:18,108 --> 00:09:20,108
