284
00:17:08,728 --> 00:17:13,728
And when the moment came...

285
00:17:25,728 --> 00:17:26,728
Get away!

286
00:17:26,728 --> 00:17:27,728
Fire!

287
00:17:27,728 --> 00:17:28,728
Fire!

288
00:17:28,728 --> 00:17:29,728
We need water!

289
00:17:29,728 --> 00:17:30,728
Hurry!

290
00:17:30,728 --> 00:17:31,728
Secure the royal family!

291
00:17:31,728 --> 00:17:32,728
Quick!

292
00:17:32,728 --> 00:17:33,728
Put it out!

293
00:17:38,728 --> 00:17:47,728
Queen Urohime has been shot!

294
00:17:47,728 --> 00:17:48,728
Hey!

295
00:17:48,728 --> 00:17:51,728
Hurry up and pay me already!

296
00:17:51,728 --> 00:17:53,728
I torched all those signatures

297
00:17:53,728 --> 00:17:54,728
like you told me to,

298
00:17:54,728 --> 00:17:55,728
so I've earned my cut.

299
00:17:55,728 --> 00:17:56,728
Still,

300
00:17:56,728 --> 00:17:57,728
I gotta get out of here

301
00:17:57,728 --> 00:17:59,728
before those guards come looking for me.

302
00:18:04,728 --> 00:18:06,728
What's the big idea?

303
00:18:06,728 --> 00:18:08,728
Humans are so stupid.

304
00:18:10,728 --> 00:18:11,728
Oh, damn it!

305
00:18:21,728 --> 00:18:23,728
It was a human!

306
00:18:23,728 --> 00:18:27,728
A human assassinated our queen!

307
00:18:27,728 --> 00:18:30,728
This is what humans are capable of!

308
00:18:30,728 --> 00:18:33,728
Killing in cold blood!

309
00:18:36,728 --> 00:18:42,728
And that was all it took to fool every single one of you!

310
00:18:45,728 --> 00:18:46,728
No!

311
00:18:46,728 --> 00:18:47,728
Damn you!

312
00:18:47,728 --> 00:18:49,728
He killed our queen!

313
00:18:49,728 --> 00:18:50,728
Hardy,

314
00:18:50,728 --> 00:18:51,728
