Stop it right now!

320
00:19:02,728 --> 00:19:11,728
She was a nuisance!

321
00:19:11,728 --> 00:19:12,728
Right, Shirohoshi?

322
00:19:14,728 --> 00:19:17,728
Always telling us to forget about revenge.

323
00:19:17,728 --> 00:19:21,728
And then begging us all to try and be friends with the humans.

324
00:19:21,728 --> 00:19:25,728
Worst of all, she was so close to getting what she wanted.

325
00:19:25,728 --> 00:19:29,728
I knew just murdering her wasn't going to cut it anymore.

326
00:19:30,728 --> 00:19:31,728
It wasn't enough!

327
00:19:31,728 --> 00:19:33,728
I had to kill her dream.

328
00:19:33,728 --> 00:19:36,728
Only then would your mother truly die.

329
00:19:36,728 --> 00:19:38,728
Shut your mouth!

330
00:19:38,728 --> 00:19:39,728
Leave her alone!

331
00:19:39,728 --> 00:19:40,728
How dare you!

332
00:19:40,728 --> 00:19:44,728
And so, I came up with a strategy.

333
00:19:44,728 --> 00:19:47,728
I would use her death to my advantage.

334
00:19:47,728 --> 00:19:53,728
With that one simple act, I could change the direction this country was moving in to my favor.

335
00:19:53,728 --> 00:19:58,728
