336
00:19:58,728 --> 00:20:04,728
Then, just like that, the islanders' hopes died alongside their queen.

337
00:20:04,728 --> 00:20:06,728
That's it.

338
00:20:06,728 --> 00:20:07,728
One human.

339
00:20:07,728 --> 00:20:10,728
That was all that it took.

340
00:20:10,728 --> 00:20:20,728
If I made one of them my scapegoat, I knew our people would feel so angry and so betrayed that they would never question it.

341
00:20:20,728 --> 00:20:23,728
As it turned out, it wasn't even that difficult.

342
00:20:23,728 --> 00:20:27,728
Every person on the island bought into it exactly like I wanted.

343
00:20:27,728 --> 00:20:32,728
Can't start a revolution without a few sacrifices.

344
00:20:32,728 --> 00:20:34,728
Right, Princess?

345
00:20:34,728 --> 00:20:39,728
Even in her death, your mother changed the island by turning the humans into villains once more.

346
00:20:39,728 --> 00:20:42,728
