354
00:21:09,728 --> 00:21:11,728
Shiro Hoshi!

355
00:21:11,728 --> 00:21:20,728
What did you say?

356
00:21:20,728 --> 00:21:31,728
A long time ago, the people of Fishman Island came together to build a mysterious giant ship.

357
00:21:31,728 --> 00:21:33,728
They called it Noah.

358
00:21:33,728 --> 00:21:36,728
The reason why they did this is unknown.

359
00:21:36,728 --> 00:21:39,728
Hence the mysterious part, obviously.

360
00:21:39,728 --> 00:21:45,728
Anyhow, it's nothing but a forgotten piece of the past until I touch it with my right hand.

361
00:21:45,728 --> 00:21:48,728
