362
00:22:00,728 --> 00:22:03,728
Guys, what's going on?

363
00:22:03,728 --> 00:22:04,728
It's over.

364
00:22:04,728 --> 00:22:07,728
The pain in my heart will never go away.

365
00:22:07,728 --> 00:22:08,728
I suspect.

366
00:22:08,728 --> 00:22:09,728
It's moving!

367
00:22:09,728 --> 00:22:10,728
I don't know what to do!

368
00:22:10,728 --> 00:22:11,728
Just run!

369
00:22:11,728 --> 00:22:18,728
I've thrown Noah at Shiro Hoshi.

370
00:22:18,728 --> 00:22:19,728
So now...

371
00:22:19,728 --> 00:22:20,728
I'm out of here!

372
00:22:20,728 --> 00:22:21,728
Wait!

373
00:22:21,728 --> 00:22:22,728
This ship is half the size of Fishman Island!

374
00:22:22,728 --> 00:22:23,728
