375
00:22:23,728 --> 00:22:24,728
Everything will be destroyed!

376
00:22:24,728 --> 00:22:25,728
You can't run from me anymore, princess!

377
00:22:25,728 --> 00:22:29,728
From now until the end of time, you can live on right here in my heart, but only there!

378
00:22:29,728 --> 00:22:30,728
Goodbye, my dear!

379
00:22:30,728 --> 00:22:31,728
I'm out of here!

380
00:22:31,728 --> 00:22:32,728
I'm out of here!

381
00:22:32,728 --> 00:22:33,728
I'm out of here!

382
00:22:33,728 --> 00:22:34,728
I'm out of here!

383
00:22:34,728 --> 00:22:35,728
I'm out of here!

384
00:22:35,728 --> 00:22:36,728
I'm out of here!

385
00:22:36,728 --> 00:22:37,728
I'm out of here!

386
00:22:37,728 --> 00:22:38,728
I'm out of here!

387
00:22:38,728 --> 00:22:39,728
Happyin' doin' finally, cassette game handed for me!

388
00:22:39,728 --> 00:22:40,728
Why is the pilot being ruined for me?!

389
00:22:40,728 --> 00:22:41,728
All this thing is, no?

390
00:22:41,728 --> 00:22:42,728
That's so cool!"

391
00:22:42,728 --> 00:22:43,728
It won't just crush her!

392
00:22:43,728 --> 00:22:45,728
Everything will be destroyed!

393
00:22:45,728 --> 00:22:46,728
You can't run from me anymore, princess!

394
